# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Cursor SDK Bridge standalone binary (download via scripts/fetch-bridge.sh)
third_party/

# Cline bridge Node dependencies (install via scripts/install-cline-bridge.sh);
# the lockfile IS committed so installs are reproducible.
src/clinesdk/bridge/node_modules/

# Local SQLite persistence ($PROJECT_ROOT/data/autonomy.db)
data/

# Deployment package produced by build.sh
outputs/

# swag 产物（scripts/register-contract.sh 生成后上报服务中心）——注解才是契约的真源，
# 产物手工改没有意义，也没必要提交（见 docs/http-api.md「服务契约」）。只产 swagger.json，
# 所以不会有 docs.go（那会把 swaggo 拖成运行期依赖）。
docs/swagger.json
docs/swagger.yaml
docs/docs.go


.DS_Store
